{"seq":3,"slug":"percentage-rollout-strategies","title":"百分比灰度策略：粘性哈希、渐进提升与紧急 Kill Switch","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/progressive-delivery/percentage-rollout-strategies","wordCount":1756,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"百分比灰度策略-粘性哈希-渐进提升与紧急-kill-switch\">百分比灰度策略：粘性哈希、渐进提升与紧急 Kill Switch</h1><h2 id=\"引言-比例即信心\">引言：比例即信心</h2><p>百分比灰度（Percentage Rollout）是渐进交付中最灵活、最常用的策略。与 <a href=\"blue-green-ring-deployments\">蓝绿部署</a> 的&quot;全切&quot;不同，百分比灰度允许在 0% 到 100% 之间的任意比例暴露新功能。其核心公式是：</p>\n<p><strong>灰度比例 = 对变更安全性的信心程度</strong></p>\n<p>从 1% 开始意味着&quot;我们有一点信心&quot;；扩展到 25% 意味着&quot;初步验证通过&quot;；推到 100% 意味着&quot;完全确认安全&quot;。这种渐进式的信心构建，让团队可以在<strong>最小化风险</strong>的前提下实现快速迭代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>百分比灰度的核心是<strong>把&quot;信心&quot;量化为 0% 到 100% 之间的一个可调比例</strong>，并让这个比例在运行时被安全地推进或收回。它建立在三个概念之上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>粘性哈希</strong>：用确定性哈希把用户稳定分配到一个比例桶中，同一用户始终看到同一版本，避免灰度割裂；</li>\n<li><strong>渐进提升</strong>：比例按阶梯逐步扩大，每步与观测窗口匹配，可人工或基于指标自动推进；</li>\n<li><strong>Kill Switch</strong>：任何阶段都能把比例瞬时归零的安全底线，且不依赖监控栈也能工作。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"粘性哈希-sticky-hashing\">粘性哈希（Sticky Hashing）</h2><p>百分比灰度的核心技术挑战是<strong>粘性（Stickiness）</strong>：同一用户在多次请求中必须看到相同的版本。如果用户刷新页面后灰度结果随机变化，体验将极其混乱。</p>\n<h3 id=\"确定性哈希算法\">确定性哈希算法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import hashlib&#10;import struct&#10;&#10;def sticky_percentage_check(user_id: str, flag_key: str, percentage: int) -&gt; bool:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    确定性百分比评估&#10;    - 同一 user_id + flag_key 组合始终返回相同结果&#10;    - 不同 flag_key 使用不同盐值，分配独立&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    # 组合用户标识与开关键作为哈希输入&#10;    hash_input = f&quot;{flag_key}:{user_id}&quot;.encode(&#39;utf-8&#39;)&#10;&#10;    # 使用 MurmurHash3（高性能、均匀分布）&#10;    hash_bytes = hashlib.sha256(hash_input).digest()&#10;    hash_value = struct.unpack(&#39;&lt;I&#39;, hash_bytes[:4])[0]&#10;&#10;    # 映射到 0-9999 的范围（万分比精度）&#10;    bucket = hash_value % 10000&#10;&#10;    # 比较桶编号与灰度百分比&#10;    return bucket &lt; (percentage * 100)  # percentage 为 0-100\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hashlib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sticky_percentage_check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, flag_key: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, percentage: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    确定性百分比评估</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    - 同一 user_id + flag_key 组合始终返回相同结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    - 不同 flag_key 使用不同盐值，分配独立</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 组合用户标识与开关键作为哈希输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hash_input </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">flag_key</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encode(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'utf-8'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 使用 MurmurHash3（高性能、均匀分布）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hash_bytes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hashlib.sha256(hash_input).digest()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hash_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> struct.unpack(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;I'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, hash_bytes[:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 映射到 0-9999 的范围（万分比精度）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hash_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 比较桶编号与灰度百分比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (percentage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># percentage 为 0-100</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"为什么不用随机数\">为什么不用随机数</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>粘性</th>\n<th>均匀性</th>\n<th>可重现</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机数</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>不适合灰度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户 ID % N</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>⚠️ 取决于 ID 分布</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>简单场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希(salt + ID) % N</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td><strong>推荐方式</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>随机数的问题显而易见：用户 A 第一次请求被分到实验组看到新功能，第二次请求却被分到对照组看到旧功能——体验割裂。</p>\n<p>简单取模（ID % 100）的问题较隐蔽：如果用户 ID 是自增整数，低位模式可能不均匀；且不同开关使用相同的分桶逻辑，导致&quot;某些用户总是在实验组&quot;。</p>\n<p>哈希方案解决了以上所有问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>粘性</strong>：确定性函数，同输入同输出</li>\n<li><strong>均匀性</strong>：密码学哈希的均匀分布特性</li>\n<li><strong>独立性</strong>：不同 flag_key 作为盐值确保开关间分配独立</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"常用哈希算法选择\">常用哈希算法选择</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>均匀性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MurmurHash3</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>LaunchDarkly/Unleash 采用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SHA-256</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>密码学安全但开销较大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FNV-1a</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>轻量级替代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xxHash</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>高性能场景首选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产环境推荐 <strong>MurmurHash3</strong> 或 <strong>xxHash</strong>——它们不需要密码学安全性（灰度分配不是安全场景），但需要极高的计算性能和均匀分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渐进提升策略\">渐进提升策略</h2><h3 id=\"标准阶梯式提升\">标准阶梯式提升</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    D[部署 0%] --&gt; S1[&quot;1% - 观测10m&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; H1{健康?}&#10;    H1 -- 是 --&gt; S2[&quot;5% - 观测30m&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; H2{健康?}&#10;    H2 -- 是 --&gt; S3[&quot;10% - 观测30m&quot;]&#10;    S3 --&gt; H3{健康?}&#10;    H3 -- 是 --&gt; S4[&quot;25% - 观测1h&quot;]&#10;    S4 --&gt; H4{健康?}&#10;    H4 -- 是 --&gt; S5[&quot;50% - 观测1h&quot;]&#10;    S5 --&gt; H5{健康?}&#10;    H5 -- 是 --&gt; S6[&quot;75%&quot;]&#10;    S6 --&gt; S7[&quot;100% 全量&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    D[部署 0%] --&gt; S1[\"1% - 观测10m\"]\n    S1 --&gt; H1{健康?}\n    H1 -- 是 --&gt; S2[\"5% - 观测30m\"]\n    S2 --&gt; H2{健康?}\n    H2 -- 是 --&gt; S3[\"10% - 观测30m\"]\n    S3 --&gt; H3{健康?}\n    H3 -- 是 --&gt; S4[\"25% - 观测1h\"]\n    S4 --&gt; H4{健康?}\n    H4 -- 是 --&gt; S5[\"50% - 观测1h\"]\n    S5 --&gt; H5{健康?}\n    H5 -- 是 --&gt; S6[\"75%\"]\n    S6 --&gt; S7[\"100% 全量\"]</pre><h3 id=\"自动化推进-automatic-progression\">自动化推进（Automatic Progression）</h3><p>现代特性管理平台支持基于指标的自动推进——无需人工在每个阶段手动扩大比例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Unleash Release Management — 自动推进配置&#10;rollout:&#10;  strategy: gradual&#10;  stages:&#10;    - percentage: 5&#10;      duration: 15m&#10;      healthCheck:&#10;        metrics: [&#39;error_rate&#39;, &#39;p99_latency&#39;]&#10;        thresholds:&#10;          error_rate: { max: 0.01 }&#10;          p99_latency: { max: 500ms }&#10;    - percentage: 25&#10;      duration: 1h&#10;      healthCheck:&#10;        metrics: [&#39;error_rate&#39;, &#39;p99_latency&#39;, &#39;conversion_rate&#39;]&#10;        thresholds:&#10;          error_rate: { max: 0.01 }&#10;          p99_latency: { max: 500ms }&#10;          conversion_rate: { min_relative: 0.95 } # 不低于基线的 95%&#10;    - percentage: 75&#10;      duration: 4h&#10;      healthCheck:&#10;        metrics: [&#39;error_rate&#39;, &#39;p99_latency&#39;, &#39;conversion_rate&#39;, &#39;revenue&#39;]&#10;    - percentage: 100&#10;&#10;  safeguards:&#10;    pauseOnFailure: true&#10;    rollbackOnCritical: true&#10;    notifyChannels: [&#39;#releases&#39;, &#39;oncall-pager&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Unleash Release Management — 自动推进配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rollout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gradual</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  stages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">15m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      healthCheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'p99_latency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        thresholds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          error_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          p99_latency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">500ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      healthCheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'p99_latency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'conversion_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        thresholds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          error_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          p99_latency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">500ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          conversion_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">min_relative</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 不低于基线的 95%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">75</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">4h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      healthCheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'p99_latency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'conversion_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'revenue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  safeguards</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    pauseOnFailure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rollbackOnCritical</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    notifyChannels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#releases'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'oncall-pager'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"推进策略的变体\">推进策略的变体</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>阶梯</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>保守型</td>\n<td>1% → 5% → 10% → 25% → 50% → 100%</td>\n<td>核心支付/交易路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准型</td>\n<td>5% → 25% → 50% → 100%</td>\n<td>一般功能发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>激进型</td>\n<td>10% → 50% → 100%</td>\n<td>低风险 UI 变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长观测型</td>\n<td>1% → 5%（等 1 天）→ 25%（等 3 天）→ 100%</td>\n<td>涉及业务指标的变更</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"何时人工介入\">何时人工介入</h3><p>自动推进不意味着完全无人值守。以下情况应暂停自动推进，由人工决策：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>业务指标模糊</strong>：指标变化在统计显著性边缘</li>\n<li><strong>上下游依赖变更</strong>：灰度期间依赖的服务发生了变更</li>\n<li><strong>节假日/大促前</strong>：高流量时期提高审慎程度</li>\n<li><strong>跨时区覆盖不足</strong>：需要等待所有时区的流量验证</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"紧急-kill-switch\">紧急 Kill Switch</h2><p>Kill Switch（紧急关闭开关）是百分比灰度策略的<strong>安全底线</strong>——当情况紧急时，不走正常的比例缩减流程，直接将灰度比例从任意值瞬间归零。</p>\n<h3 id=\"kill-switch-的设计原则\">Kill Switch 的设计原则</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Kill Switch 的关键要求&#10;interface KillSwitch {&#10;  // 1. 瞬时生效：不依赖缓存刷新周期&#10;  propagationLatency: &#39;&lt; 1 second&#39;;&#10;&#10;  // 2. 无条件覆盖：覆盖所有其他规则&#10;  priority: &#39;highest&#39;;&#10;&#10;  // 3. 操作极简：一键/一命令触发&#10;  activation: &#39;single-action&#39;;&#10;&#10;  // 4. 不依赖复杂系统：当监控系统挂了，Kill Switch 仍要能工作&#10;  independence: &#39;no dependency on monitoring stack&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Kill Switch 的关键要求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KillSwitch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 1. 瞬时生效：不依赖缓存刷新周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  propagationLatency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '&#x3C; 1 second'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 2. 无条件覆盖：覆盖所有其他规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  priority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'highest'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 3. 操作极简：一键/一命令触发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  activation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'single-action'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 4. 不依赖复杂系统：当监控系统挂了，Kill Switch 仍要能工作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  independence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'no dependency on monitoring stack'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"kill-switch-实现模式\">Kill Switch 实现模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 模式 1：平台内建 Kill Switch&#10;def evaluate_flag(flag_key, context):&#10;    flag = get_flag(flag_key)&#10;&#10;    # Kill Switch 检查最先执行，覆盖一切&#10;    if flag.killed:&#10;        return flag.kill_value  # 通常是 OFF/默认行为&#10;&#10;    # 正常规则评估&#10;    return evaluate_rules(flag.rules, context)&#10;&#10;&#10;# 模式 2：独立的 Kill Switch 层&#10;def should_enable_feature(feature_name, context):&#10;    # Kill Switch 独立于特性开关系统&#10;    if kill_switch_service.is_killed(feature_name):&#10;        return False&#10;&#10;    # 正常的特性开关评估&#10;    return feature_flag_service.evaluate(feature_name, context)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 模式 1：平台内建 Kill Switch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evaluate_flag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(flag_key, context):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    flag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_flag(flag_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Kill Switch 检查最先执行，覆盖一切</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.killed:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.kill_value  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 通常是 OFF/默认行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 正常规则评估</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> evaluate_rules(flag.rules, context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 模式 2：独立的 Kill Switch 层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> should_enable_feature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(feature_name, context):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Kill Switch 独立于特性开关系统</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kill_switch_service.is_killed(feature_name):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 正常的特性开关评估</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feature_flag_service.evaluate(feature_name, context)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"与事故响应的集成\">与事故响应的集成</h3><p>Kill Switch 是 <a href=\"../../site-reliability-engineering/\">SRE 事故响应</a>的第一道防线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[事故发生] --&gt; B[On-call 收到告警]&#10;    B --&gt; C{与近期开关变更相关?}&#10;    C -- 是 --&gt; D[触发 Kill Switch - 秒级止血]&#10;    D --&gt; E[服务恢复 → 事后分析根因]&#10;    C -- 否 --&gt; F[走正常事故响应流程]&#10;    F --&gt; G{Kill Switch 有效?}&#10;    G -- 否 --&gt; H[排查其他原因]\">flowchart TD\n    A[事故发生] --&gt; B[On-call 收到告警]\n    B --&gt; C{与近期开关变更相关?}\n    C -- 是 --&gt; D[触发 Kill Switch - 秒级止血]\n    D --&gt; E[服务恢复 → 事后分析根因]\n    C -- 否 --&gt; F[走正常事故响应流程]\n    F --&gt; G{Kill Switch 有效?}\n    G -- 否 --&gt; H[排查其他原因]</pre><h3 id=\"kill-switch-的传播机制\">Kill Switch 的传播机制</h3><p>Kill Switch 的特殊要求是<strong>极低的传播延迟</strong>——即使正常的开关同步使用轮询（30s 间隔），Kill Switch 也需要在秒级内生效：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传播方式</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SDK 轮询</td>\n<td>15-30s</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>常规开关变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSE 流式推送</td>\n<td>&lt;1s</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Kill Switch + 常规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专用 Kill 通道</td>\n<td>&lt;500ms</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>仅 Kill Switch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地缓存超时</td>\n<td>配置化</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>兜底机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"百分比灰度与用户体验\">百分比灰度与用户体验</h2><h3 id=\"避免灰度割裂\">避免灰度割裂</h3><p>灰度期间的用户体验一致性至关重要。粘性分配确保同一用户始终看到相同版本，避免新旧交替的割裂体验。用户 A 被哈希分到&quot;新 UI&quot;组后，无论访问多少次，始终看到新 UI，直到灰度结束或 Kill Switch 触发。</p>\n<h3 id=\"关联功能的一致性\">关联功能的一致性</h3><p>当多个开关属于同一个功能集时，它们应该使用相同的分桶：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 相关开关共享分桶，避免用户看到不一致的组合&#10;FEATURE_GROUP = &quot;checkout-v2&quot;&#10;&#10;flags = {&#10;    &quot;checkout-v2-ui&quot;: {&quot;group&quot;: FEATURE_GROUP, &quot;percentage&quot;: 25},&#10;    &quot;checkout-v2-api&quot;: {&quot;group&quot;: FEATURE_GROUP, &quot;percentage&quot;: 25},&#10;    &quot;checkout-v2-email&quot;: {&quot;group&quot;: FEATURE_GROUP, &quot;percentage&quot;: 25},&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 同一用户在以上三个开关中看到一致的结果&#10;# 因为它们使用相同的 group 作为哈希盐值\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 相关开关共享分桶，避免用户看到不一致的组合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FEATURE_GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"checkout-v2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">flags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"checkout-v2-ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"group\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FEATURE_GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"percentage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"checkout-v2-api\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"group\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FEATURE_GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"percentage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"checkout-v2-email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"group\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FEATURE_GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"percentage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 同一用户在以上三个开关中看到一致的结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 因为它们使用相同的 group 作为哈希盐值</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"灰度通知策略\">灰度通知策略</h3><p>对于用户可感知的功能变更，考虑在灰度期间适当通知用户：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>新功能提示</strong>：在灰度组用户首次看到新功能时展示引导</li>\n<li><strong>反馈入口</strong>：给灰度组用户提供便捷的反馈通道</li>\n<li><strong>退出机制</strong>：允许灰度组用户主动退出（回到旧版本）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"百分比灰度的监控看板\">百分比灰度的监控看板</h2><h3 id=\"关键指标看板设计\">关键指标看板设计</h3><p>一个完善的灰度监控看板应包含以下信息：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Canary 值</th>\n<th>Baseline 值</th>\n<th>变化率</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Error Rate</td>\n<td>0.3%</td>\n<td>0.2%</td>\n<td>+50%</td>\n<td>警告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Latency P99</td>\n<td>180ms</td>\n<td>150ms</td>\n<td>+20%</td>\n<td>正常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Conversion</td>\n<td>3.2%</td>\n<td>3.1%</td>\n<td>+3%</td>\n<td>正常</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>看板需要展示当前灰度阶段（如 25%）、目标（100%）、时间线（各阶段推进记录），以及 Kill Switch 一键回退按钮。关键操作包括：Advance（推进到下一阶段）、Pause（暂停自动推进）、Kill Switch（紧急归零）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高级模式-多维百分比\">高级模式：多维百分比</h2><p>除了全局百分比，还可以在特定维度内做百分比灰度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;flag&quot;: &quot;new-recommendation&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rules&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;企业客户先行&quot;,&#10;      &quot;conditions&quot;: [{ &quot;attribute&quot;: &quot;tier&quot;, &quot;operator&quot;: &quot;eq&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;enterprise&quot; }],&#10;      &quot;percentage&quot;: 50,&#10;      &quot;variation&quot;: &quot;enabled&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;全量用户灰度&quot;,&#10;      &quot;percentage&quot;: 10,&#10;      &quot;variation&quot;: &quot;enabled&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"flag\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"new-recommendation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"企业客户先行\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"conditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"attribute\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"operator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"enterprise\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"percentage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"variation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"enabled\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"全量用户灰度\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"percentage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"variation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"enabled\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>含义：企业客户中 50% 看到新推荐，普通用户中 10% 看到新推荐。这允许对高价值或低风险群体优先验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>百分比灰度策略的核心要素：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>粘性哈希</strong>：确定性的用户分桶是灰度体验一致性的基础</li>\n<li><strong>渐进阶梯</strong>：比例提升步长与观测时间匹配变更风险</li>\n<li><strong>自动推进</strong>：基于指标的自动化减少人工干预</li>\n<li><strong>Kill Switch</strong>：任何阶段都有瞬时归零的安全底线</li>\n<li><strong>关联一致性</strong>：同一功能集的多个开关共享分桶</li>\n</ol>\n<p>百分比灰度依赖 <a href=\"../foundations/targeting-segmentation\">目标定向规则</a> 的基础能力，其健康指标监控与 <a href=\"../operations/observability-flag-impact\">可观测性</a> 深度集成。SDK 层面的实现细节参见 <a href=\"../engineering/sdk-architecture-patterns\">SDK 架构模式</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"百分比灰度策略：粘性哈希、渐进提升与紧急 Kill Switch","id":"百分比灰度策略-粘性哈希-渐进提升与紧急-kill-switch"},{"level":2,"text":"引言：比例即信心","id":"引言-比例即信心"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"粘性哈希（Sticky Hashing）","id":"粘性哈希-sticky-hashing"},{"level":3,"text":"确定性哈希算法","id":"确定性哈希算法"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不用随机数","id":"为什么不用随机数"},{"level":3,"text":"常用哈希算法选择","id":"常用哈希算法选择"},{"level":2,"text":"渐进提升策略","id":"渐进提升策略"},{"level":3,"text":"标准阶梯式提升","id":"标准阶梯式提升"},{"level":3,"text":"自动化推进（Automatic Progression）","id":"自动化推进-automatic-progression"},{"level":3,"text":"推进策略的变体","id":"推进策略的变体"},{"level":3,"text":"何时人工介入","id":"何时人工介入"},{"level":2,"text":"紧急 Kill Switch","id":"紧急-kill-switch"},{"level":3,"text":"Kill Switch 的设计原则","id":"kill-switch-的设计原则"},{"level":3,"text":"Kill Switch 实现模式","id":"kill-switch-实现模式"},{"level":3,"text":"与事故响应的集成","id":"与事故响应的集成"},{"level":3,"text":"Kill Switch 的传播机制","id":"kill-switch-的传播机制"},{"level":2,"text":"百分比灰度与用户体验","id":"百分比灰度与用户体验"},{"level":3,"text":"避免灰度割裂","id":"避免灰度割裂"},{"level":3,"text":"关联功能的一致性","id":"关联功能的一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"灰度通知策略","id":"灰度通知策略"},{"level":2,"text":"百分比灰度的监控看板","id":"百分比灰度的监控看板"},{"level":3,"text":"关键指标看板设计","id":"关键指标看板设计"},{"level":2,"text":"高级模式：多维百分比","id":"高级模式-多维百分比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"蓝绿部署与环形发布：多环策略与流量路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/progressive-delivery/blue-green-ring-deployments"},"next":{"title":"SDK 架构模式：客户端与服务端的评估引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/engineering/sdk-architecture-patterns"}}